### process_upload_chunk — Atomic State Machine (Test-Verified)

```
POST /v1/upload/chunk  (multipart: upload_id, chunk_index, chunk_hash + file)
    │
    ├─ Redis HGETALL(meta_key) → 404 if empty
    ├─ user_id check → 403 if mismatch
    ├─ chunk_index range check → 400 if ≥ total_chunks
    ├─ Compute SHA-256 of incoming bytes → 400 if != chunk_hash
    │
    └─ atomic_chunk_state(bitmap_key, hashes_key, meta_key, chunk_index, chunk_hash, TTL)
            │  (Lua script: atomic GETBIT + SETBIT)
            ├── returns 1 (already_uploaded) → skip write, return current state
            └── returns 0 (new chunk)
                    Write chunk bytes to .parts/{upload_id}/{chunk_index:06d}.part
                    → UploadChunkResponse(received_chunks=bitcount, complete=(bitcount==total_chunks))
```

### finalize_upload — Two Paths (Test-Verified)

```
POST /v1/upload/finalize
    │
    ├─ Redis HGETALL(meta_key) → 404 if empty
    ├─ user_id check → 403
    ├─ master_hash match against meta["master_hash"] → 400 if mismatch
    │
    ├─ PATH A: meta["linked_file_id"] is set (duplicate_suspected fast-link)
