            ├─ Assemble chunks → FINAL_ROOT/{uuid} using shutil.copyfileobj
            ├─ Create UploadedFile row in DB
            └─ Jump to mapping insert

[Both paths]
    │
    ├─ pg_insert(DatasetFolderFilesMapping).values(...).on_conflict_do_nothing(
